    <string name="privacy_policy_content">Azokle is engineered on a zero-knowledge architecture. We do not log your searches, track your IP address, store browser fingerprints, or sell user telemetry. All history and session cookies remain encrypted on your device and can be permanently incinerated with a single tap.</string>
